title: Banker_Intro
tags:
---
CFO Adeleke: Welcome to Meridian Capital, Analyst.
CFO Adeleke: Our morning ledger showed a 4.2 million naira shortfall between POS receipts and actual recognized revenue.
CFO Adeleke: The board of directors is meeting in twenty minutes. If we don't isolate the discrepancy, trading will be halted.
-> Analyst: I have my analytical tablet ready. Let me inspect the transaction callset.
    CFO Adeleke: Good. Here is the direct database pipeline into our payment gateway logs.
    <<trigger_data_task "datasets/meridian_bank_ledger.csv" "meridian_revenue_audit">>
-> Analyst: What payment channels should I be most skeptical of?
    CFO Adeleke: Pay special attention to pending and reversed merchant transactions. Some tellers recorded them as finalized revenue.
    <<trigger_data_task "datasets/meridian_bank_ledger.csv" "meridian_revenue_audit">>
===

title: Banker_Success
tags:
---
CFO Adeleke: Brilliant work! You isolated the pending reversals!
CFO Adeleke: The true recognized revenue is exactly 18,420,500 naira. The board was about to panic over phantom funds.
CFO Adeleke: Here is your Certified Financial Forensic badge. Take the expressway north to the Courthouse—the Crown Prosecutor needs your assistance.
===

title: Banker_Retry
tags:
---
CFO Adeleke: Wait... these figures don't balance. 
CFO Adeleke: Look closely at the transaction statuses. Did you filter out the refunded and processing charges?
CFO Adeleke: Re-open your tablet and verify the status column.
<<trigger_data_task "datasets/meridian_bank_ledger.csv" "meridian_revenue_audit">>
===
